      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mosman",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Mosman Historical Society, founded in 1953 by Jack Carroll, preserves local history and publishes works such as \"Mosman: Times Gone By\".",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
