      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A 6‑inch naval gun was mounted at Lower Georges Heights Battery in 2006 to replicate a historic coastal gun that defended Sydney Harbour in the early 1900s.",
